# Mabel, Heir to Cragflame: "Other Mice you control get +1/+1" and "When Mabel enters, create Cragflame, a legendary colorless Equipment
# artifact token ..." (CR 613.4c, 205.3m, 111.4, 603.6a). Bot1 casts Stampeding Scurryfoot (a 1/1 Mouse) and Memnite (not a Mouse), then Mabel
